{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulless and forgotten. Shadows of the damned playing a game where each call could be their last. Do you dare to take a seat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this <strong>first-person multiplayer game</strong>, sit down at the table and try your best at different game modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Sum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the lowest cards set. Make a call at anytime but watch out as you may be the one endangered... Make use of some helpful items to disturb your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trust Wish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't see your death but others can. Talk to your enemies and make them trust you. But do you trust them?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1803830?t=1761144268","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1803830?t=1761144268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803830/3a3c118030eb2f1653f158fa02720b65795d1cf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761144268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803830/3a3c118030eb2f1653f158fa02720b65795d1cf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761144268","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game includes violence and fear elements."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulless and forgotten. Shadows of the damned playing a game where each call could be their last. Do you dare to take a seat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this <strong>first-person multiplayer game</strong>, sit down at the table and try your best at different game modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Sum</h2><